  "title": "Simple Soy Sauce Chicken",
  "description": "Just mix up a few pantry ingredients, including a small can of mushrooms, Italian salad dressing, and soy sauce, and simmer chicken pieces until tender and flavorful. It's an easy weeknight supper the family will ask for. Serve it over rice.",
